{"study_accession":"PRJNA647826","secondary_study_accession":"SRP273258","title":"Potential MDDC reprogramming when exposed to BKPyV","description":"Absence of significant mRNA profile modifications upon BKPyV co-culture in human MDDC suggesting no cell reprogramming. Overall design: MDDC from four distinct blood donors were analyzed by 3′ digital gene expression (DGE) RNAseq. The libraries were prepared from 10 ng of total RNA. The mRNA poly(A) tails were tagged with universal adapters, specific barcodes and unique molecular identifiers (UMIs) during template switching reverse transcriptase. Barcoded cDNAs from multiple samples were pooled, amplified and tagmented using a transposon-fragmentation. The obtained library was on an Illumina HiSeq 2500. After read counting, DESeq 2 was used to normalize expression.","pubmed":"33592065","geo_series":"","n_samples":8,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN15590136","study_accession":"PRJNA647826","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"infected DC [RNA_DC_PLUS]","description":"infected DC [RNA_DC_PLUS]","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM4680447","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-01-15","attributes":[["source_name","MDDC_with BKPyV"],["cell_type","blood monocyte-derived dendritic cells (MDDC)"],["type","primary cells"],["source subject","adult"],["treatment","with BKPyV (Dunlop strain, MOI=0.1)"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR12303170","experiment_accession":"SRX8806120","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":16066313,"base_count":890111749,"first_public":"2021-01-15","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM4680447: infected DC [RNA_DC_PLUS] Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN15590137","study_accession":"PRJNA647826","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"non infected DC [RNA_DCNEG]","description":"non infected DC [RNA_DCNEG]","sex":"","geo_sa